  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray with baking paper. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-01af1000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut corn in half.\n• Thinly slice tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, half the garlic aioli, the white wine vinegar and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In a small bowl, combine the butter and a small pinch of mild Caribbean jerk seasoning (the rest will be used in step 3!).\n• Bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-09544510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based burger patties until browned and heated through, 2-3 minutes each side.\n• TIP: For even browning, gently press down on the patties using a spatula.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-88262620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the patties are cooking, place corn cobs into the saucepan of boiling water. Cook until tender and bright yellow, 5 minutes. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-fcd03c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire rack in the oven until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-e8408840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build your burgers by spreading a layer of the remaining aioli over the base of a bun.\n• Top with the Jerk plant-based patty burger, tomato and slaw. Serve with the fries and corn cobs.\n• Spread the Jerk butter over the corn. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-4c105150.jpg"
    }
  ]
